# Assembled release artifacts and their receipts. These are build outputs that
# get attached to a GitHub Release, never committed — the APK alone is ~200 MB.
release/
CLAUDE.md
CODEX_CHANGELOG.md
.claude/
.factory/
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Markdown is local-only by default. Documentation that README, the app, or a
# release gate links to must be tracked, or those links 404 on GitHub — the
# in-app Settings > About > Privacy policy button opens one of them.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/**/*.md

# Factory-loop research artifacts are session history, not published docs.
docs/research/

